flowchart TB
  accTitle: fi-fhir authoring and delivery
  accDescr: Mapping Studio authors immutable definitions. The server admits messages durably before dispatching deliveries and exposes receipts for verification. The CLI also runs independently.

  STUDIO["Mapping Studio<br/>samples · profiles · workflows"]
  PREVIEW["Session preview + simulation<br/>diagnostics · lineage · recorded runs"]
  DEFINITION["Integration definition<br/>compiled connections + registry profile/workflow"]
  RELEASE["Validate → approve → publish<br/>Operator deploys the release"]
  STUDIO --> PREVIEW --> DEFINITION --> RELEASE

  subgraph SERVER["Integration engine · fi-fhir serve"]
    INPUT["MLLP · authenticated HTTP · S3/SFTP batch"]
    KERNEL["Resolve immutable revision<br/>parse → project → plan delivery"]
    STORE["PostgreSQL transaction<br/>receipt + canonical events + lineage + outbox"]
    DISPATCH["Delivery worker<br/>retry · circuit breaker · dead letter queue"]
    OUTPUT["Configured destinations<br/>HTTPS · FHIR · Kafka"]
    INPUT --> KERNEL --> STORE --> DISPATCH --> OUTPUT
  end

  RELEASE -. admission gate .-> KERNEL
  PREVIEW -. shared kernel in preview mode .-> KERNEL
  VERIFY["Verification + Operator<br/>admissions · statistics · retention · attempts"]
  STORE --> VERIFY
  DISPATCH --> VERIFY
